{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-paced action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_Combat_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a high-energy game that requires rapid movement, frenetic combat, and immediate decision-making. In this dynamic environment, you will have to adapt quickly to changes and emerging threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A soul shared by 4 characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Switch_Character_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your soul is shared by four characters with different abilities and characteristics. Switch characters at any time and unleash combos and synergies against your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A World in Transformation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_ChangingSMS_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bononia depicts a world disfigured by nightmares and is in constant transformation. By facing nightmares and evil spirits you can change its fortunes or plunge into an even worse nightmare. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizing Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_UI_NewAbility_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuously collect, upgrade and refine your powers. Discard those that no longer serve your path and experiment with new ways of dealing with the many threats. Magic flows through your veins and you will tap into every drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_Idol_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third-person frenetic action: Master the frenetic movement mechanics to run and jump through enemies with evasive maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival in procedural dungeons: Beneath the city lies a huge network of dungeons and catacombs. Measure yourself against these dangers to become stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own build with each run: unlock effigies and upgrade with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 biomes with different creatures and bosses: nightmares take many different forms, face yours.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2843680?t=1738358047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738358047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/3b2ede47259ffc2637619487026525fbd64a1207/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738358047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/3b2ede47259ffc2637619487026525fbd64a1207/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738358047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-paced action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_Combat_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a high-energy game that requires rapid movement, frenetic combat, and immediate decision-making. In this dynamic environment, you will have to adapt quickly to changes and emerging threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A soul shared by 4 characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Switch_Character_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your soul is shared by four characters with different abilities and characteristics. Switch characters at any time and unleash combos and synergies against your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A World in Transformation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_ChangingSMS_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bononia depicts a world disfigured by nightmares and is in constant transformation. By facing nightmares and evil spirits you can change its fortunes or plunge into an even worse nightmare. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizing Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_UI_NewAbility_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuously collect, upgrade and refine your powers. Discard those that no longer serve your path and experiment with new ways of dealing with the many threats. Magic flows through your veins and you will tap into every drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/VB-Gif_Idol_600x330.gif?t=1738358047\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third-person frenetic action: Master the frenetic movement mechanics to run and jump through enemies with evasive maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival in procedural dungeons: Beneath the city lies a huge network of dungeons and catacombs. Measure yourself against these dangers to become stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own build with each run: unlock effigies and upgrade with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 biomes with different creatures and bosses: nightmares take many different forms, face yours.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Power Up Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/header.jpg?t=1738358047","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257093846,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093846/movie480.mp4?t=1738358042","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093846/movie_max.mp4?t=1738358042"},"name":"Vespera Bononia Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093846/fa53bfdc396917607f20c64de0228f964461ab05/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738358042","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093846/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738358042","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093846/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738358042"}}],"name":"Vespera Bononia","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 64-bit/ Windows\u00ae 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050Ti / AMD Radeon RX 570 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 64-bit/ Windows\u00ae 11<br></li><li><strong